 temporary files and atomic `os.Rename`.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/verify/anti_shim.go`: Refined `checkSinglePanicShim` so non-literal `panic(err)` calls are not misclassified as placeholder stubs, and added `isUnconditionalGoTestSkip` for Go `*_test.go` parity with polyglot `test_skip_reward_hack`.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/verify/anti_shim_test.go`: Added test coverage for `panic(err)` helpers and unconditional Go `t.Skip` detection.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/mem/search.go`: Normalized `dead-end` and `dead_end` memory kinds in `matchesSearchFilter` and `CalculateTemporalDecay`.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_hook_helpers.go`: Restricted `/brain/` trunk exemptions in `isPermittedWorktreePath` to Antigravity brain artifact directories.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_hook_post.go`: Blocked `--no-verify`, `git commit -n`, and `NOMOS_*_IN_PROGRESS=` hook-bypass spoofing in `evaluateCommandGuard`.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_verify.go`: Marked worktree trace state dirty via `markWorktreeVerificationFailed` when `nomos verify` fails in-process.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_hook_trace.go`: Scoped `MutatedFiles` to worktree-interior non-`.tmp/` paths, tightened `isNomosVerificationCommand`, re-marked `DirtyUnverifiedEdits` when `PostToolUse` observes verification failure output, and persisted trace files atomically.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_hook_trace_parity.go`: Extracted Receipt-Trace Parity validators, removed the 0-diff bypass in `findUnchangedClaimedFileInChangesSection`, and added `rollbackTrunkMergeOnDBError`.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_task_sync.go`: Recorded `preMergeSHA` prior to `fastForwardTrunkMerge` and rolled back trunk if `store.UpdateTask` fails.\n- `substrate/cli/cmd_hook_hardening_test.go`: Added unit tests covering `/pkg/brain/` trunk blocking, `--no-verify` and env-spoof command denials, failed `nomos verify` Stop blocking, and 0-diff `## Changes` parity enforcement.\n\n## Verification\n- Executed unit tests across `core/workspace`, `core/capbac`, `core/config`, `modules/verify`, `modules/mem`, and `cli`.\n- Verified all 42 Definition of Done gates via `nomos task commit` and `nomos task sync SUB-2181`.\n","sha256_receipt":"be98e74363636d6bf4c6ae0ae7c6a7d8743ededcc7d6cfc8c10f9ec35bdd6861"}
